{"about_the_game":"Entropy 2120 is an extremely difficult First Person Shooter set in a dystopian futuristic world on the brink of collapse.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/777730/extras/0487da76dbeeddb22c77de0783cce923.poster.avif?t=1773488766\" width=560 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/777730/extras/0487da76dbeeddb22c77de0783cce923.webm?t=1773488766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/777730/extras/0487da76dbeeddb22c77de0783cce923.mp4?t=1773488766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>This game features fast, punishing first-person combat. You won't find any cover and your health will not regenerate until you use items or abilities. Every time you die you lose your Inventory and your experience points. You'll need to find your Corpse to regain your resources.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/777730/extras/936eebd00a0128e7e990023a6e7bd42c.poster.avif?t=1773488766\" width=560 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/777730/extras/936eebd00a0128e7e990023a6e7bd42c.webm?t=1773488766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/777730/extras/936eebd00a0128e7e990023a6e7bd42c.mp4?t=1773488766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In 2120 Earth is almost uninhabitable. The lucky ones live on the other planets of the Solar System. You are a mercenary who, after being killed, has been brought back to life by an artificial intelligence and forced to perform a dangerous mission on behalf of one of the most powerful corporations of the solar system.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Extremely Difficult and unforgiving fast paced firefights<br></li><li>Every time you die, you lose your Inventory and your experience points. You will need to find your Corpse to regain your resources.</li><li>Character Development: Choose which of your abilities to enhance.<br></li><li>No health Regeneration! You will need to use consumables or abilities to recover your health</li><li>Intense Boss Fights</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"0590172e44c64ef97c4d790d3d2f9ab7dc643d5d.jpg","localized_name":"Welcome to 2120","name":"Welcome to 2120","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/777730/0590172e44c64ef97c4d790d3d2f9ab7dc643d5d.jpg"},{"icon":"f6f16916f5c9ebd8395767796761036d93928915.jpg","localized_name":"Shadow slayer","name":"Shadow slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/777730/f6f16916f5c9ebd8395767796761036d93928915.jpg"},{"icon":"1a1d31f2020eac2eec4b21f05bf7b637e020ac0d.jpg","localized_name":"Hank.free = true;","name":"Hank.free = true;","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/777730/1a1d31f2020eac2eec4b21f05bf7b637e020ac0d.jpg"},{"icon":"b19fd16651e648562c3307528433f51af4204a59.jpg","localized_name":"It's Just the begginning...","name":"It's Just the begginning...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/777730/b19fd16651e648562c3307528433f51af4204a59.jpg"},{"icon":"0c7daa9e3f14316c89110f649ba48499b495bd0c.jpg","localized_name":"Tank","name":"Tank","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/777730/0c7daa9e3f14316c89110f649ba48499b495bd0c.jpg"},{"icon":"0692d3c5361513f5b5d494f1ade9f9daffa52fdd.jpg","localized_name":"Mercenary","name":"Mercenary","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/777730/0692d3c5361513f5